        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Implant Core"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe grikkitog implants its core into an adjacent section of earth or stone, melding seamlessly and changing its visual appearance to match the surrounding rock. It's immobilized but automatically succeeds at its Deception check to Impersonate the stone around it; creatures actively searching for it can still attempt Perception checks against its Deception DC as normal. A grikkitog can release its implantation as a free action, which has the manipulate trait. A grikkitog's infestation aura and manifold vision are only active while implanted."
            },
